* ''The swarm's procedures re-think once the Lararium stands'' (operator, 2026-11-13: //"We shall have to completely re-think our multi-model & swarm procedures once we have the fully standing Lararium."//). The multi-model and swarm procedures (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/mixed-model-swarm`>>, the lane law of controller-handoff) take a complete re-think once the Lararium fully stands; until then they hold as written. Owed in #/the-leaps, after the walk.

